  <item>
    <title>Vol.39 夏日漫漫谈——伏特东北亚大探索和鸡翅嘻哈西安行</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a7d264817676351c571155d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a7d264817676351c571155d</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>各位听友我们回来了！！！今年实在太忙了，各位主播都在拼命为了生活奋斗ing。但是，我们回来了，带来了久违的夏日漫漫谈节目~大Xuan与怂哥、沈老师在延边到底经历了什么？是美食的诱惑，还是人文的震撼，还是东北亚商城的冲击？红烧鸡翅的西安嘻哈之行有经历了哪些有意思的故事？那些活在音乐里的rapstar真实什么样？这些故事将在本期娓娓道来，点击收听吧~</span></p><p><span>主播：大Xuan、怂哥、红烧鸡翅</span></p><p><span>【Songlist】</span></p><p><span>《蒋市村的PunkStar》—李法德</span></p><p><span>《Kickinit Alone》—Kiefer</span></p><p><span>《热水器》—红烧鸡翅Wings</span></p><p><span>【Shownotes】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">00:45</a> 为什么我们消失了一段时间！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="62">01:02</a> 但是我们休假去了一趟延边、长春</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="165">02:45</a> 延吉必须得吃烤肉，超有性价比！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="220">03:40</a> 图门和珲春建议大家一定去看看</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="242">04:02</a> 朝鲜人民的质朴，更加感叹祖国的伟大</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="355">05:55</a> 珲春在中国发展上有很重要的地位，它是东北之眼！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">07:30</a> 珲春必吃！各类东洋大蟹和超级大烤串！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="573">09:33</a> 珲春大串除了串大，料也不一样！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="745">12:25</a> 珲春住宿都不贵，很有性价比</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="773">12:53</a> 来长春不去掀杯喝一杯真的白来了！强烈推荐</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="798">13:18</a> 长春、延吉消费差别，为什么延吉整体消费会比较高？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="874">14:34</a> 长春必去伪满皇宫，伏特旅行团在长春的参观趣闻</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1072">17:52</a> 本次旅行心得，景点市场同质化太强，产品太雷同</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1138">18:58</a> 商贩很热情，但话术有点没道理，你见过按年轮计算的鱿鱼吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1325">22:05</a> 稀奇、奇怪的东北亚商贸城探访，究极俄货大陈列！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1424">23:44</a> 神秘的数码3C副楼到底有什么奥秘？最大的展厅竟然是卖这个的？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1816">30:16</a> 怂哥延边之旅受到了臭酱汤的灵魂震慑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2125">35:25</a> 延边的美食到底有多香？司机为我们带来了最真实地展现</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2185">36:25</a> 红烧鸡翅最近都干嘛了！去西安的tuzi电台录制了！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2293">38:13</a> 派克特老师带鸡翅美美吃汤包，但是鸡翅啥也没吃明白</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2423">40:23</a> 刘大胡子熏肉大饼——鸡翅倾情推荐</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2490">41:30</a> 西安hiphop环境到底怎么样？这些rapstar真实是什么样？鸡翅代表北京都干什么了！！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2680">44:40</a> 26年鸡翅年!!!!!!</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2714">45:14</a> 红烧鸡翅下半年如果有演出，伏特送听众门票~</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6586f1c8e6715903886a6c76/lu_XqcR2o_PBjtmjVH2B-Bs7aQaQ.m4a" length="48792806" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:50:17</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmkbGkNBM2i7D9uQqCKF1ASw3Vlx.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.37 板仔，骑士，涂鸦客？当我回到街头，身份就无需定义</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69cf1c76e2c8be315540fc3c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69cf1c76e2c8be315540fc3c</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 03 Apr 2026 14:41:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们请来了一位真正的“街头青年”——00后，玩滑板、搞涂鸦、骑机车，一个人环海南岛骑行。他的生活状态，让主播们集体羡慕到词穷。</span></p><span></span><p><span>很多人问，街头文化到底是什么？我们觉得，就是四个字：忠于本心。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我的生活是什么样，我就是什么样。不需要条条框框限制自己。</span></p><span></span><p><span>是滑板摔了十次还站起来，是喷出第一幅涂鸦作品时手抖但爽到飞起，是骑着摩托追日落、风吹透T恤的自由。</span></p><span></span><p><span>点击收听就对了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：大Xuan、怂哥、红烧鸡翅</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：Q瓷</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Songlist】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《HOOLIGANG》-Joey Valence &amp; Brae</span></p><span></span><p><span>《What They Do》-The Roots / Raphael Saadiq</span></p><span></span><p><span>《The World Is Yours》-Nas</span></p><span></span><p><span>附：Q瓷涂鸦作品（正规涂鸦场地）、Q瓷摩托车环海南留念照片</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuIVixVETe3LP46DDle65SaHNynE.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FujnkX2BgF9Ho3mbeQPBBOTO9Q_q.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqKWOuMHPebIoiPYfuLMslN6Nk3T.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【Shownotes】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="214">03:34</a> Q瓷的滑板启蒙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="621">10:21</a> 关于学习滑板的那点儿事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a> 什么是呲杆儿？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1085">18:05</a> 滑板运动的分类，街式和碗池</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1412">23:32</a> 玩滑板容易受伤吗？玩滑板的前提建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1724">28:44</a> 滑板对学习和成长有什么帮助吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1905">31:45</a> 涂鸦分类大科普，字体？tag？公仔，这些都是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2193">36:33</a> 玩涂鸦的工具和手法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2684">44:44</a> 一幅涂鸦作品的操作方法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2795">46:35</a> 一幅街头涂鸦怎么快速完成</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2848">47:28</a> 第一幅上墙作品在哪？有什么样的缘分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3320">55:20</a> Q瓷都做过什么涂鸦作品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3485">58:05</a> 涂鸦能玩中国风吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3558">59:18</a> 如何通过官方途径学习涂鸦技巧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3936">65:36</a> 如何得到一个属于自己的涂鸦风格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4260">71:00</a> Q瓷的机车启蒙和他的改装Chopper</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4450">74:10</a> 毫不犹豫，我要骑着摩托环海南</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4710">78:30</a> 开局逆风，深陷沙滩，在海南环形的各种情况！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4842">80:42</a> Q瓷环海南骑行的各种见闻</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6586f1c8e6715903886a6c76/lhFOFrTLFVszwvuZbTXaDi145f9-.m4a" length="86867886" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:29:31</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnEaCxb_zXhH4Oo4CmACsuANLJK0.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.36 疯狂的年货</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/699b56bca22480add6bc0a56</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">699b56bca22480add6bc0a56</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 23 Feb 2026 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2026年的春节，主播们再次感悟到大城市的“年味”在不断流失。唯独保留的年味好像都汇集到了年货上，从各类礼盒到五花八门的干果、水果，有自制的酱货熟食，也有零食大礼包。你也在春节吃水果吃到鼻血吗？你也打不开夏威夷果吗？还会和爸爸妈妈去超市买年货吗？一起聊聊在买年货、吃年货、送年货的各种趣闻轶事，承包你最后的春节气氛！</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：大Xuan、怂哥、红烧鸡翅、大芬儿、大D</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Songlist】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《春節序曲（間奏）》-BENJAMIN (ZHEJIANG)&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>《中国人不蹦洋迪》-MARSIX刘家良; 颜沐宸Ace</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Gong Xi ! Gong Xi !》-Jeremy Monteiro&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Gong Xi Fa Cai !》-Jeremy Monteiro&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>《恭喜发财》-刘德华</span></p><span></span><p><span>《春节梦》-Vansdaddy; Lil Asian</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Shownotes】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="127">02:07</a> 26年大家的年都怎么过的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="596">09:56</a> 二次元漫画推荐《再见绘梨》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="895">14:55</a> 年味的丧失，对于燃放烟花爆竹的倡议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1012">16:52</a> 年货——年味的浓缩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1112">18:32</a> 激动人心的环节，来到超市听《恭喜发财》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1228">20:28</a> 我们与年货水果的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">25:30</a> 大芬儿与桂圆的不解之缘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1775">29:35</a> 我们与年货干果、酱货的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2617">43:37</a> 年货米面油和健康饮食</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2868">47:48</a> 特别且有趣的年货送礼往事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3360">56:00</a> 当你拥有春节怎么过、如何买年货、送年货串亲戚的决定权，你想做什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3932">65:32</a> 大D对于年味渐淡的思考</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6586f1c8e6715903886a6c76/lkLhfNfuFt6vAIp8CzRrS3L3iNZ6.m4a" length="70615107" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:12:46</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpHIwbJuUsIhJUN53adUjFrWkOXT.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.35 再见2025，你好2026｜播客两周年、25年关键词、未来大预言</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6992b99ca22480add647f03b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6992b99ca22480add647f03b</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 17 Feb 2026 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>春节之际，终于迎来了一年一度的、万众期待的年度大荟萃节目。我们一同回忆过往录制最深刻的节目，选出了25年自己的关键词，也对即将到来的马年进行了一系列大胆且有趣的预言。所以，如果我们一直更新，会有我们的同人文吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：大Xuan、怂哥、红烧鸡翅、大芬儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Songlist】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《轻熟女 27》-MC Hotdog 热狗/关彦淳</span></p><span></span><p><span>《心太软》-任贤齐</span></p><span></span><p><span>《不见不散》-孙楠</span></p><span></span><p><span>《sans（杉斯）》-Toby Fox</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Shownotes】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="128">02:08</a> 25年的第一个改变，大芬儿迎来了小猫咪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">08:50</a> 大芬新一年的脱北计划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="875">14:35</a> 未知伏特2周年，新的计划和目标</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 26年对于录制内容的新想法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2852">47:32</a> 怂哥的年度关键词——陪伴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3212">53:32</a> 红烧鸡翅的年度关键词——进步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3900">65:00</a> 大芬儿的年度关键词——突破</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4110">68:30</a> 认真的男人不会心太软</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4260">71:00</a> 大Xuan的年度关键词——适应</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5040">84:00</a> 关于离别，我们有话说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5635">93:55</a> 脑洞时间——2026年会有怎样的大趋势出现？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6586f1c8e6715903886a6c76/lhMiHN1614DYmQxtFJ5B00_v9RWj.m4a" length="104709182" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:47:48</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FujREU24vjJ33woFOiqIG00jkAgc.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.34 暖冬漫谈｜消极录音的检讨、胡闹的婚礼幻想、走心的旅行和温暖的菜饭</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/698e9c0766e2c303774dfeb3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">698e9c0766e2c303774dfeb3</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 14 Feb 2026 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目始于几位主播在一起对于未知伏特现状与未来的反思、检讨。我们到底为什么疏于更新（bushi），都在忙什么？从一场说走就走的旅行、难忘的婚礼经历、鸡翅的说唱生涯。深刻又胡闹的暖冬漫谈，点击播放！</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：大Xuan、怂哥、红烧鸡翅</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Songlist】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《雨中漫步（嘉豪之歌）》-红烧鸡翅（未发布）</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Green》-Robohands</span></p><span></span><p><span>《What We Were Waiting For》-Lophae / Greg Sanders / Tom Herbert / Sam Rapley / Ben Brown</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Vicentina》-Lophae / Greg Sanders / Tom Herbert / Sam Rapley / Ben Brown</span></p><span></span><p><span>《恩宁街跨年夜（I'll Be There For You）》-庄主恒</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Shownotes】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="155">02:35</a> 我们最近在干什么？未知伏特的未来该怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="941">15:41</a> 鸡翅痴迷创作，嘉豪带来新音乐的创作灵感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1171">19:31</a> 鸡翅参与了姐姐的婚礼，开启了一场疯狂的婚礼创想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1765">29:25</a> 关于红烧鸡翅的未来，如何把握机遇走上成功之路？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2273">37:53</a> 怂哥的日本京都+大阪之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3345">55:45</a> 怂哥登顶京都鞍马山，大Xuan要在日本立一连廊的鸟居？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3665">61:05</a> 经典美食种草时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4440">74:00</a> 大xuan的出差总结，湘西奇妙体验和一碗苏州的温心菜饭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5010">83:30</a> 怂哥手作戒指体验</span></p>]]></description>
