    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>阔别已久，终于更新！我们汇集了今年日本出行的所有经历、感受、攻略，为大家带来本期日本旅行的超全分享来啦！怂哥和沈老师第一次赴日旅行是什么感觉？大Xuan独自旅行为何遇到惊魂时刻，又如何见证自己的少年感？大芬是通过什么方式在旅行中拓宽商业版图？各位扣紧安全带，跟随未知伏特一起出发！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>（本期分享仅为个人感官，如有偏差，欢迎讨论）</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：怂哥、大芬儿、大Xuan</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：沈老师</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Songlist】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《鼓动(飞翔バージョン)》-吉田兄弟</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Blue Eyes》-Masaru Imada Trio</span></p><span></span><p><span>《The Way We Were》-山本刚</span></p><span></span><p><span>《浮花 -Floating Flowers-》-Hizuru</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Butter-Fly》-和田光司</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Shownotes】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> 日本旅行的行程介绍和主播主观评价</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="573">09:33</a> 出发旅行之心做什么攻略了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="700">11:40</a> 预订酒店、新干线、飞机实用指南</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> 第一站：东京Tokyo</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2772">46:12</a> 第二站：富士山</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3280">54:40</a> 富士山KABA巴士游玩攻略</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3620">60:20</a> 日本新干线购票攻略</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4160">69:20</a> 第三站：大阪，老何加入团队！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4760">79:20</a> 未知伏特勇闯日本环球影城</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5795">96:35</a> 兵分两路！怂哥、沈老师、老何他们在大阪都去哪了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6470">107:50</a> 大Xuan的南纪白浜Solo trip</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7880">131:20</a> 旅行的意义是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>KABA巴士</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkt-Wn3Ak3FZNg9jM181dJL9NMp6.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>与好友东京重聚</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrfLOfoxLjFeK1Mzk-ICwYYgylPO.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>南纪白浜落日</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/liBpPGU8j8K4QsqJ9vqgx-5yvxcc.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
