  <item>
    <title>Vol.26 我们的青春修炼手册（上）—中二病、恶作剧和叛逆</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67ed04baf9578163d6926c36</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67ed04baf9578163d6926c36</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 03 Apr 2025 11:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>春天来了，万物复苏。提到春，不得不提起“青春期”，这个人类发育中的春季。在花样的春日里，我们“中二”过，我们犯过错，我们也快乐过。今天就揭开我们的青春黑历史，揭秘这本青春修炼手册。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：怂哥、红烧鸡翅、大芬儿、大Xuan</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Songlist】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《素颜》-许嵩</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Perfect Strangers》-Lophae/Greg Sanders/Tom Herbert/Ben Brown/Sam Rapley</span></p><span></span><p><span>《春风吹》-方大同</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Shownotes】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> 青春期必修课——中二病</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="237">03:57</a> 大Xuan的中二黑历史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="760">12:40</a> 大芬——我是学校的零食商业帝王</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1155">19:15</a> 揭秘男生为什么会空气投篮</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1520">25:20</a> 除了空气投篮，还有什么中二病表现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1880">31:20</a> 青春期必修课——恶作剧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a> Ryan与大Xuan的口香糖惨案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">36:00</a> 大芬对恶意同学的反击</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2250">37:30</a> 我们的泡芙大摆锤和怂哥的蔫坏经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2650">44:10</a> 上学时期的无序混乱，打雪仗和阿鲁巴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a> 青春期最大问题—拿样儿的“叛逆”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3032">50:32</a> 家有难题，我要叛逆—怂哥为何给自己扇肿了脸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3380">56:20</a> 大xuan与父亲因为考试的一次“争吵”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3557">59:17</a> 鸡翅，一瓶水，一个处分，爸爸的耳光</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3751">62:31</a> 大芬的爸爸用马鞭教育他</span></p>]]></description>
