    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【伏特福利】在本期播客下面评论或私信后台，即可获得3月22日DJ Bowen“Dr.Melody”活动邀请函，含一杯免费酒水</span></p><span></span><p><span>这个春天我们迎来了阔别已久的“书生DJ”Bowen。这次作客未知伏特，Bowen带来了自己的专场音乐派对“旋律博士”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是一场什么演出？为什么叫这个名字？他本次会放什么种类的音乐？他与活动承办方Trust相信电音又有怎么样的故事呢？一起点击收听吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：怂哥、大芬儿、大Xuan</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：DJ Bowen</span><br><span></span></p><span></span><p><span>【Songlist】</span></p><span></span><p><span>DJ Bowen'S Set</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Some Jazz To Make Love》-Bellaire</span><br><span></span></p><span></span><p><span>【Shownotes】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="155">02:35</a> Bowen再临未知伏特是为何？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="205">03:25</a> “旋律博士”Party介绍及福利</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="285">04:45</a> 本次派对音乐会是什么风格？什么是Melody House？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="340">05:40</a> 本次派对主题竟然是爱死机吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="435">07:15</a> 大Xuan对活动主题的畅想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="575">09:35</a> 此次活动，都有哪些DJ嘉宾？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="875">14:35</a> Bowen与大饼老师“伯乐与千里马”一样的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="926">15:26</a> 探密Trust相信电音厂牌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1255">20:55</a> 流行与地下，电子乐能与流行音乐或者其他元素结合吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1400">23:20</a> Bowen是如何挖掘出好音乐的呢？BeatsPort让Bowen打开新世界大门</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1706">28:26</a> AI帮你做音乐，这事您怎么看？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1885">31:25</a> 这一段时间，Bowen有什么变化吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2115">35:15</a> Bowen觉得怎么样才是一位好DJ？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2135">35:35</a> “旋律博士”party将削弱VJ和视觉，希望大家放下手机，享受音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2315">38:35</a> Bowen会有什么服装搭配吗？怂哥和大Xuan出狠活了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2470">41:10</a> Bowen灵魂发问，“未知伏特”对法超的评价。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2525">42:05</a> 法超好像一处都市忙碌中的音乐室外桃源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a> Bowen灵魂发问2，你们喜欢电子乐吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3026">50:26</a> Bowen 做好准备代表Trust相信电音、扛起北京电子乐大旗的责任了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3092">51:32</a> 要不先做商业店的DJ，再做地下电子乐扛旗人也行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3159">52:39</a> 除了在法超，你还能在哪里找到Bowen放音乐？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3360">56:00</a> 致敬那些为青年文化努力的机构、平台、工作者</span></p>]]></description>
